1
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:28,510
Senior,

2
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:30,790
could this coffin

3
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:35,520
have been deliberately left for us
by Hong?

4
00:00:36,430 --> 00:00:37,750
She knew the people
from the Tianxiang Sect

5
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:39,480
would find her sooner or later,

6
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,280
so she spread false news

7
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,750
that the child was dead

8
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:44,810
and even made a fake grave.

9
00:00:45,070 --> 00:00:46,330
The whole point was...

10
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:51,100
to make sure no one could find
Shangguan Chengming.

11
00:00:53,070 --> 00:00:54,640
People in our line of work

12
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:56,210
rarely have offspring.

13
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:59,140
Whether it's karma or just coincidence,

14
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,470
who can tell?

15
00:01:00,670 --> 00:01:03,400
You've never gotten over
what the old Sect Master

16
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:05,310
said to you back then.

17
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:08,200
He said you'd never have offspring.

18
00:01:08,310 --> 00:01:10,480
But now you have a son.

19
00:01:11,070 --> 00:01:12,230
I...

20
00:01:13,650 --> 00:01:15,010
am honestly envious.

21
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:18,280
Is that so?

22
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:20,000
Senior,

23
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:21,789
if I were you,

24
00:01:22,390 --> 00:01:24,120
even if he weren't really mine,

25
00:01:27,580 --> 00:01:29,530
I'd still raise him as my own.

26
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:32,520
Do you really think he's worthy
of being my son?

27
00:03:18,540 --> 00:03:22,590
[A Prophet]

28
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:25,560
[Episode 22]

29
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,380
Shangguan Chengming,

30
00:03:30,590 --> 00:03:32,240
I must congratulate you.

31
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:34,910
You ran this scam beautifully.

32
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,470
Others set the trap,

33
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,800
and you reap the rewards.

34
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:41,890
Second Brother,

35
00:03:42,170 --> 00:03:43,970
are you talking about his career

36
00:03:44,450 --> 00:03:45,640
or love life?

37
00:03:46,190 --> 00:03:47,400
Get lost.

38
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,730
Still, we really owe you

39
00:03:50,310 --> 00:03:52,570
for what happened with the Zhang family.

40
00:03:52,710 --> 00:03:54,910
I must propose a toast to you.

41
00:03:58,520 --> 00:04:00,430
Feiyan, since you're toasting
Second Brother,

42
00:04:00,430 --> 00:04:02,030
shouldn't you two
drink a cross-cupped toast?

43
00:04:02,030 --> 00:04:02,800
What do you think, Third Brother?

44
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:03,360
Yes.

45
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,800
You two should drink a cross-cupped toast.

46
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,190
No problem.

47
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,590
Thank you, Second Master.

48
00:04:07,590 --> 00:04:08,450
Come on, Yanzi!

49
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,840
Second Brother is blushing.

50
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,120
You know nothing.

51
00:04:13,430 --> 00:04:14,430
For Fifth Batou,

52
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,390
if she so much as says the word,

53
00:04:16,390 --> 00:04:17,750
I'd give my life.

54
00:04:18,510 --> 00:04:19,240
Fifth Batou.

55
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:23,120
You guys saved Li Ling?

56
00:04:30,170 --> 00:04:32,100
This has nothing to do with others.

57
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:33,510
I did it all on my own.

58
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:36,630
I just couldn't stand watching you men
live the good life

59
00:04:36,630 --> 00:04:37,890
while we women suffer.

60
00:04:45,070 --> 00:04:45,930
Second Master,

61
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,400
Fifth Batou saved the Paozi.

62
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:50,920
Does that count as ruining the scam?

63
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:55,900
Sixth Brother,

64
00:04:56,070 --> 00:04:58,600
I'm a little drunk today.

65
00:04:58,740 --> 00:05:00,740
Let's forget about the rules first.

66
00:05:00,830 --> 00:05:01,720
At least

67
00:05:02,190 --> 00:05:03,190
we all made money,

68
00:05:03,270 --> 00:05:03,630
right?

69
00:05:03,630 --> 00:05:04,800
Rules are rules.

70
00:05:05,510 --> 00:05:06,440
Second Brother,

71
00:05:06,630 --> 00:05:08,090
I'll ask you one more time.

72
00:05:08,110 --> 00:05:09,560
Does Jiang Feiyan saving the Paozi

73
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:10,240
count

74
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,750
as ruining the scam?

75
00:05:19,030 --> 00:05:21,540
I could hear you shouting from far away.

76
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:22,770
Sect Master.

77
00:05:22,830 --> 00:05:23,750
Master.

78
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,100
What happened?

79
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:34,310
Fifth Batou and Shangguan Chengming

80
00:05:34,630 --> 00:05:36,390
saved a Paozi in a scam.

81
00:05:36,510 --> 00:05:37,630
They were also the ones

82
00:05:37,630 --> 00:05:38,750
who ruined the scam.

83
00:05:38,750 --> 00:05:39,390
Well...

84
00:05:39,409 --> 00:05:40,220
It's up to you.

85
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,460
What do you think we should do?

86
00:05:50,630 --> 00:05:51,490
Sixth Brother.

87
00:05:53,159 --> 00:05:54,420
Shangguan Chengming.

88
00:05:54,620 --> 00:05:56,430
According to the Tianxiang Sect's rules,

89
00:05:56,430 --> 00:05:57,159
either

90
00:05:58,430 --> 00:05:59,950
you kill Jiang Feiyan,

91
00:06:00,100 --> 00:06:00,940
or...

92
00:06:01,320 --> 00:06:02,560
I'll kill

93
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,720
both of you today.

94
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:39,640
Why should I kill her?

95
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:42,170
I did break the rules.

96
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:45,310
But did I stop us from making money?

97
00:06:45,310 --> 00:06:48,010
The rules are the backbone
of the Tianxiang Sect.

98
00:06:48,010 --> 00:06:50,540
You ruined the scam,
so you broke the rules.

99
00:06:50,570 --> 00:06:53,240
You didn't mind it
when you put the money in your pocket,

100
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:55,440
but now you're talking about the rules?

101
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:56,640
The Sect Master

102
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,540
is treating everyone
to a whole roast lamb today.

103
00:06:58,540 --> 00:06:59,710
A live lamb

104
00:06:59,740 --> 00:07:01,650
costs 5 silver dollars at the market.

105
00:07:01,650 --> 00:07:02,870
Once it's cooked and served,

106
00:07:02,870 --> 00:07:04,830
it's worth 20.

107
00:07:05,990 --> 00:07:07,470
And as for the Zhang family's scam,

108
00:07:07,470 --> 00:07:08,910
the other Batous see it

109
00:07:08,930 --> 00:07:10,880
as a deal worth 50 gold bars.

110
00:07:11,670 --> 00:07:12,790
But to me,

111
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:14,440
it's worth 500.

112
00:07:14,470 --> 00:07:15,960
What's the point?

113
00:07:20,550 --> 00:07:21,430
See?

114
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:24,360
When there's meat,
everyone's eyes are on the meat.

115
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,690
Now that there's money,

116
00:07:25,870 --> 00:07:27,730
everyone's eyes are on the money.

117
00:07:27,850 --> 00:07:29,180
Now everyone in Yuzheng

118
00:07:29,270 --> 00:07:31,040
knows that soul-trapping rituals
bring wealth.

119
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:32,360
They're all asking around

120
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,750
about who can perform that.

121
00:07:33,750 --> 00:07:35,480
Zhang and his son went to jail,

122
00:07:35,870 --> 00:07:36,630
but I can find you 50 more

123
00:07:36,630 --> 00:07:39,230
Zhangs and their sons
just like them in no time.

124
00:07:39,390 --> 00:07:41,040
If I remember correctly,

125
00:07:41,159 --> 00:07:43,159
the first rule of the Tianxiang Sect

126
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:45,159
is to overthrow the Qing
and restore the Ming.

127
00:07:45,159 --> 00:07:47,270
The Qing Dynasty has been gone for ages.

128
00:07:47,270 --> 00:07:47,950
So what now?

129
00:07:48,270 --> 00:07:50,730
Should we disband
the Tianxiang Sect today?

130
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:53,580
The old rules have held
the Tianxiang Sect back for too long.

131
00:07:53,580 --> 00:07:54,840
We only made it this far

132
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,450
because the Sect Master changed the rules.

133
00:07:56,450 --> 00:07:58,510
How dare you compare yourself
to the Sect Master?

134
00:07:58,510 --> 00:07:59,510
He did it for his brothers.

135
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:00,370
What about you?

136
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:03,120
Today, you dared to break the rules
for a few gold bars.

137
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:05,000
Tomorrow, you'll dare
to tear down the Sect Master's altar!

138
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:05,720
Fine!

139
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:09,070
Then there's another rule
in the Tianxiang Sect:

140
00:08:09,070 --> 00:08:11,000
when you run a scam, you don't kill.

141
00:08:11,190 --> 00:08:12,850
But I believe every Batou here

142
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:14,680
has spilled plenty of blood.

143
00:08:15,170 --> 00:08:16,970
By your logic,

144
00:08:23,110 --> 00:08:25,640
shouldn't you all be killed today?

145
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:42,870
We've got
a perfectly good roast lamb here,

146
00:08:42,870 --> 00:08:44,490
and you're here talking about killing.

147
00:08:44,490 --> 00:08:45,650
We eat the meat,

148
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,080
we make the money,

149
00:08:47,550 --> 00:08:49,000
and we follow the rules.

150
00:08:49,510 --> 00:08:50,320
In this scam,

151
00:08:50,910 --> 00:08:52,640
Yanzi and Shangguan Chengming

152
00:08:52,750 --> 00:08:53,790
have done both good

153
00:08:53,790 --> 00:08:54,440
and bad.

154
00:08:54,630 --> 00:08:55,510
I'll keep that

155
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:57,200
in mind for now.

156
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:58,790
Next,

157
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,460
Shangguan Chengming.

158
00:09:02,190 --> 00:09:03,460
We'll all wait for

159
00:09:04,030 --> 00:09:07,030
those 50 Zhangs and their sons
you promised.

160
00:09:08,450 --> 00:09:09,090
Alright?

161
00:09:10,070 --> 00:09:10,710
Yes.

162
00:09:14,130 --> 00:09:14,960
Let's eat.

163
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:16,030
Yes.

164
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:16,920
Let's eat.

165
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:18,320
Let's make a toast

166
00:09:18,630 --> 00:09:19,360
to the Sect Master!

167
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,120
Here, here.

168
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:20,580
Master.

169
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:21,120
Master.

170
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:22,120
Drink up. Come on.

171
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:42,280
You know what?

172
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,940
The Sect Master is raising

173
00:09:45,140 --> 00:09:46,740
a lot of children in the sect.

174
00:09:47,270 --> 00:09:48,390
Most of them

175
00:09:49,260 --> 00:09:51,320
were Abaos' illegitimate children.

176
00:09:52,740 --> 00:09:53,800
Some were abandoned babies

177
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:55,260
picked up off the streets.

178
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:57,610
Others

179
00:09:58,470 --> 00:10:00,530
were bought from human traffickers.

180
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:03,110
Why does the Sect Master
raise so many children?

181
00:10:03,110 --> 00:10:04,560
You see them as children,

182
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:06,790
but to him,

183
00:10:07,400 --> 00:10:09,200
they're tools for making money.

184
00:10:10,750 --> 00:10:12,010
The good-looking ones

185
00:10:12,310 --> 00:10:13,970
are sold to wealthy families.

186
00:10:14,390 --> 00:10:15,320
The clever ones

187
00:10:16,150 --> 00:10:18,210
stay in the Tianxiang Sect as agents.

188
00:10:18,390 --> 00:10:19,510
As for

189
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,670
the disabled ones,

190
00:10:22,150 --> 00:10:24,120
they're kept at the sect
to do spiritual cons

191
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:24,980
and hard labor.

192
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:26,480
That's why I said

193
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,440
I've had so many chances

194
00:10:29,820 --> 00:10:31,420
to leave the Tianxiang Sect,

195
00:10:31,460 --> 00:10:32,590
but I could never go.

196
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,730
But even if you stay in the sect,

197
00:10:34,870 --> 00:10:36,930
you can only protect them for a while.

198
00:10:37,030 --> 00:10:38,830
The Tianxiang Sect is a wolf den.

199
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:42,480
Whoever takes it over
will do the same thing.

200
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,200
Yeah.

201
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,650
If you kill the Sect Master,

202
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,520
you'll get your revenge.

203
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,720
But once the old Sect Master steps down,

204
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,320
a new one will take his place.

205
00:10:52,390 --> 00:10:53,550
It won't make

206
00:10:54,510 --> 00:10:55,710
any difference to us.

207
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:57,700
I think the same way you do.

208
00:10:57,750 --> 00:10:59,750
Killing the Sect Master is not hard,

209
00:11:00,140 --> 00:11:01,800
but it won't change the world.

210
00:11:02,290 --> 00:11:03,550
What I really want to do

211
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:06,600
is expose the truth
about the Tianxiang Sect.

212
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:07,840
I want the world to see

213
00:11:08,060 --> 00:11:10,030
their deceiving witchcraft,

214
00:11:10,730 --> 00:11:11,610
and to see

215
00:11:11,660 --> 00:11:14,060
the living hell they've created for people

216
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,850
like me and those children.

217
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:18,840
I don't just want
to bring the Sect Master down.

218
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:20,960
I want to wipe out the Tianxiang Sect

219
00:11:22,230 --> 00:11:23,350
root and branch.

220
00:11:36,590 --> 00:11:39,120
You seem like you have something
on your mind.

221
00:11:39,270 --> 00:11:40,720
Just say it.

222
00:11:41,790 --> 00:11:42,320
Master.

223
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:44,510
You once said

224
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:48,300
that when running a scam,
you have to use their desires as bait.

225
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:50,870
But the bait Shangguan Chengming
is offering you now

226
00:11:50,870 --> 00:11:52,130
is right up your alley.

227
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:53,680
My alley?

228
00:11:55,150 --> 00:11:56,030
I think

229
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:58,820
he's been running a scam on you all along.

230
00:12:01,750 --> 00:12:02,880
Running a scam on me?

231
00:12:04,490 --> 00:12:05,850
Get me some water.

232
00:12:08,910 --> 00:12:09,870
Look at it.

233
00:12:23,710 --> 00:12:24,550
Sect Master.

234
00:12:25,130 --> 00:12:26,260
You wanted to see me?

235
00:12:26,640 --> 00:12:27,950
Have some tea with me.

236
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:29,480
Sit.

237
00:12:33,900 --> 00:12:35,630
Why are you sitting here today?

238
00:12:37,510 --> 00:12:38,600
It's cool out here.

239
00:12:42,010 --> 00:12:43,650
Have you tried this?

240
00:12:44,290 --> 00:12:44,900
Try it.

241
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:46,800
Hechuan pastry?

242
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,150
Your mother

243
00:12:49,170 --> 00:12:50,760
loved these back in the day.

244
00:12:54,520 --> 00:12:55,980
I don't need you to tell me.

245
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:01,030
Look at that.

246
00:13:03,910 --> 00:13:06,110
A few days ago, someone sent me a coffin,

247
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:08,040
saying that the one lying inside

248
00:13:08,040 --> 00:13:09,440
is Shangguan Chengming.

249
00:13:14,570 --> 00:13:15,660
Want to open it?

250
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:20,780
You've already seen it, haven't you?

251
00:13:22,460 --> 00:13:23,550
I want to see it too.

252
00:13:27,390 --> 00:13:28,920
There's a skeleton inside.

253
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:31,200
To be honest with you,

254
00:13:31,260 --> 00:13:33,590
it was Zhang Dancheng
who had it sent here.

255
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:34,380
Obviously,

256
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:36,480
he wants me to know

257
00:13:36,980 --> 00:13:39,110
that you're not Shangguan Chengming,

258
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:40,840
then to use me to kill you.

259
00:13:41,130 --> 00:13:44,790
That way, he gets to watch a father and son
turn against each other.

260
00:13:48,550 --> 00:13:49,280
Sixth Batou.

261
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:50,030
Master.

262
00:13:50,150 --> 00:13:51,000
Have some men

263
00:13:51,550 --> 00:13:53,960
carry this coffin
to the middle of the courtyard.

264
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:55,030
Find me a torch.

265
00:13:55,790 --> 00:13:57,440
I'll burn it myself.

266
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:58,320
Okay.

267
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:02,720
I just want you to understand

268
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:04,200
who the real bad guy is

269
00:14:05,280 --> 00:14:07,010
between me and Zhang Dancheng.

270
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:17,170
Good job.

271
00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:19,450
Sixth Batou,

272
00:14:20,020 --> 00:14:21,380
take Chengming

273
00:14:21,780 --> 00:14:23,780
and call Zhang Dancheng over later.

274
00:14:24,050 --> 00:14:27,030
It's been a while since the two of us
old friends have seen each other.

275
00:14:27,030 --> 00:14:28,030
Once you find him,

276
00:14:28,750 --> 00:14:30,030
you'll know the truth

277
00:14:31,150 --> 00:14:32,390
for yourself.

278
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:46,960
Come on, bro.

279
00:14:47,160 --> 00:14:47,960
To a happy day!

280
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:54,240
Liang.

281
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:56,360
You're so generous.

282
00:14:57,520 --> 00:14:58,520
Well...

283
00:14:58,630 --> 00:15:00,990
Our Sixth Master
has a beef with your brother,

284
00:15:00,990 --> 00:15:02,780
yet you're still willing to drink with me.

285
00:15:02,780 --> 00:15:03,910
You're a good buddy.

286
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:06,270
If you hadn't put out all this meat today,

287
00:15:06,270 --> 00:15:07,470
who'd drink with you?

288
00:15:07,910 --> 00:15:10,370
I'm probably saying something I shouldn't,

289
00:15:10,910 --> 00:15:11,750
but I think

290
00:15:12,270 --> 00:15:14,790
Sixth Master isn't being fair.

291
00:15:15,180 --> 00:15:16,660
We're all in the same sect.

292
00:15:16,690 --> 00:15:19,180
Why does he have to keep giving
Chengming a hard time?

293
00:15:19,180 --> 00:15:20,920
You and I both work
for the people above us.

294
00:15:20,920 --> 00:15:22,360
If they give us an order,

295
00:15:22,560 --> 00:15:23,840
don't we have to follow it?

296
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:25,630
When have we ever dared say no?

297
00:15:26,030 --> 00:15:26,720
Exactly.

298
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:28,170
If you ask me,

299
00:15:28,430 --> 00:15:29,860
let's forget about

300
00:15:29,880 --> 00:15:31,240
their grudges today.

301
00:15:31,270 --> 00:15:34,100
Let's just enjoy ourselves!

302
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:34,580
Come on!

303
00:15:34,580 --> 00:15:35,620
Come on, bro!

304
00:15:39,270 --> 00:15:39,870
Pour it.

305
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:40,670
Come on.

306
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:41,550
Cheers!

307
00:15:45,030 --> 00:15:46,030
Let me do it.

308
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:49,000
Bro!

309
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:49,360
Here!

310
00:15:56,630 --> 00:15:58,840
You can really drink, Liang.

311
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:00,870
I still think

312
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:04,930
my brother Chengming
is getting a raw deal.

313
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:05,840
Yes.

314
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:07,930
Sixth Master...

315
00:16:09,510 --> 00:16:11,120
isn't being very fair.

316
00:16:11,160 --> 00:16:11,670
Yeah.

317
00:16:11,700 --> 00:16:12,650
I think you're right.

318
00:16:12,650 --> 00:16:13,610
And how so?

319
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:15,600
Yes.

320
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:24,690
Liang?

321
00:16:24,730 --> 00:16:25,890
What are you doing?

322
00:16:26,010 --> 00:16:28,140
We haven't finished drinking, Liang.

323
00:16:28,380 --> 00:16:29,020
Liang!

324
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:31,630
Liang?

325
00:16:32,390 --> 00:16:33,150
Liang?

326
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:46,520
Tie him up tight.

327
00:16:46,550 --> 00:16:49,120
Stay here and keep watch
until I get back tonight.

328
00:16:49,120 --> 00:16:49,790
Yes!

329
00:16:59,750 --> 00:17:02,210
This place is actually pretty comfortable.

330
00:17:28,270 --> 00:17:29,270
Sixth Batou?

331
00:17:29,350 --> 00:17:31,740
Master Zhang, long time no see.

332
00:17:32,210 --> 00:17:34,300
You think just because Shangguan

333
00:17:34,330 --> 00:17:36,190
didn't tell us, we can't find you?

334
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:39,490
Mentor,

335
00:17:40,370 --> 00:17:42,700
the Sect Master sent me
to invite you back.

336
00:17:46,350 --> 00:17:47,200
Sure.

337
00:17:48,500 --> 00:17:50,500
Let me finish this one last scam.

338
00:17:50,520 --> 00:17:52,250
That's not necessary, Master.

339
00:17:52,390 --> 00:17:54,790
We run scams to make money.

340
00:17:55,080 --> 00:17:56,590
Right now, you might be able

341
00:17:56,590 --> 00:17:57,880
to make money,

342
00:17:58,350 --> 00:17:59,880
but you won't live to the day to spend it.

343
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:00,550
Is that so?

344
00:18:02,750 --> 00:18:04,400
If I can make money,

345
00:18:05,070 --> 00:18:06,530
I can definitely spend it.

346
00:18:07,750 --> 00:18:10,160
I heard there's a new orphanage in town.

347
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:12,640
I want to leave the children some money.

348
00:18:13,090 --> 00:18:14,240
Master, your skills

349
00:18:15,080 --> 00:18:16,320
are as sharp as ever.

350
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:17,600
By the way,

351
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:19,830
the old eunuch in the scam about Cao San

352
00:18:19,830 --> 00:18:21,720
was you, wasn't it?

353
00:18:23,620 --> 00:18:24,340
What?

354
00:18:25,030 --> 00:18:26,090
You want to kill me?

355
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:27,070
Fine.

356
00:18:27,250 --> 00:18:28,640
Once I die,

357
00:18:28,790 --> 00:18:29,880
it won't be long

358
00:18:30,070 --> 00:18:31,920
before Cao San figures it out.

359
00:18:37,840 --> 00:18:38,710
Let's go.

360
00:18:39,070 --> 00:18:40,000
Sixth Batou.

361
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:44,480
This is the deposit for my scam.

362
00:18:45,560 --> 00:18:47,320
Ten gold bars in total.

363
00:18:47,690 --> 00:18:50,180
This will be the last scam I ever run.

364
00:18:50,350 --> 00:18:51,640
Once I finish it,

365
00:18:51,770 --> 00:18:53,500
I'll give you half of the money.

366
00:18:53,790 --> 00:18:54,450
After that,

367
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:57,130
I'll go with you, along with the money.

368
00:18:57,350 --> 00:19:00,150
You can even
collect a reward from the Sect Master.

369
00:19:00,590 --> 00:19:02,000
What do you say?

370
00:19:07,580 --> 00:19:09,170
What if I say no?

371
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:22,270
Mr. Jin.

372
00:19:23,030 --> 00:19:23,830
Mr. Jin.

373
00:19:24,350 --> 00:19:25,070
Mr. Jin.

374
00:19:25,070 --> 00:19:26,270
I've got something good here.

375
00:19:26,270 --> 00:19:27,400
It's damn good.

376
00:19:30,560 --> 00:19:31,440
We've got company?

377
00:19:31,440 --> 00:19:32,200
How about I...

378
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:33,310
No need.

379
00:19:33,310 --> 00:19:34,270
They're all friends.

380
00:19:34,270 --> 00:19:35,750
Come on, let me introduce everyone.

381
00:19:35,750 --> 00:19:38,110
This is Mr. Song, Song Yangqun.

382
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:39,930
Nice to meet you.

383
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:41,200
Nice to meet you.

384
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:42,200
Here's the thing.

385
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:43,660
I heard that Chairman Liu is a fan

386
00:19:43,660 --> 00:19:45,420
of Master Zheng's paintings.

387
00:19:45,550 --> 00:19:47,510
This painting, Bamboo in a Gentle Breeze,

388
00:19:47,510 --> 00:19:49,240
is an original by Master Zheng.

389
00:19:50,560 --> 00:19:51,460
I specifically...

390
00:19:51,460 --> 00:19:52,460
Prepare some tea.

391
00:19:52,630 --> 00:19:53,740
Don't be so polite.

392
00:19:54,030 --> 00:19:54,590
I know

393
00:19:54,720 --> 00:19:56,680
you're good friends with Chairman Liu,

394
00:19:56,680 --> 00:19:58,210
so I brought this over first

395
00:19:58,270 --> 00:20:00,310
to get your opinion.

396
00:20:02,790 --> 00:20:03,720
Careful.

397
00:20:05,350 --> 00:20:06,200
Well?

398
00:20:14,030 --> 00:20:14,750
Mr. Jin,

399
00:20:15,010 --> 00:20:17,540
is there something wrong
with this painting?

400
00:20:18,180 --> 00:20:19,290
Mr. Zheng's bamboo

401
00:20:19,350 --> 00:20:22,000
should have thin stalks

402
00:20:22,040 --> 00:20:23,720
and full leaves,

403
00:20:24,070 --> 00:20:25,480
with contrasting shades.

404
00:20:25,480 --> 00:20:28,280
This painting looks like his work,

405
00:20:28,310 --> 00:20:31,510
but it lacks his boldness and spirit.

406
00:20:32,790 --> 00:20:33,920
It can't be fake.

407
00:20:34,550 --> 00:20:35,960
I paid a fortune for it.

408
00:20:36,240 --> 00:20:37,000
I bought it at an auction house.

409
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:38,220
I even had someone authenticate it.

410
00:20:38,220 --> 00:20:39,860
I'll listen to your explanation,

411
00:20:39,860 --> 00:20:41,120
but will Chairman Liu?

412
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:42,110
Don't tell him you saw me.

413
00:20:42,110 --> 00:20:43,110
This way, please.

414
00:20:44,400 --> 00:20:45,640
Come on, Mr. Jin.

415
00:20:45,880 --> 00:20:46,680
Please don't.

416
00:20:46,680 --> 00:20:47,750
You have to help me.

417
00:20:47,830 --> 00:20:50,430
Otherwise,
I'm stuck with this fake painting.

418
00:20:50,480 --> 00:20:51,350
Mr. Jin,

419
00:20:51,510 --> 00:20:52,590
please do me a favor.

420
00:20:52,590 --> 00:20:54,830
Could you come with me
to the auction house

421
00:20:54,830 --> 00:20:56,270
and help clear up
this whole fake-painting mess?

422
00:20:56,270 --> 00:20:57,070
Mentor,

423
00:20:57,340 --> 00:20:59,010
since Mr. Song is so sincere,

424
00:20:59,750 --> 00:21:01,230
why don't you help him out?

425
00:21:01,350 --> 00:21:02,350
Exactly, Mr. Jin.

426
00:21:02,370 --> 00:21:03,320
Well, you see...

427
00:21:05,110 --> 00:21:06,770
Please, you've got to help me.

428
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:10,890
How about this?

429
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:12,570
You can be the driver

430
00:21:12,850 --> 00:21:13,960
and send us there.

431
00:21:16,040 --> 00:21:16,570
Sure.

432
00:21:17,240 --> 00:21:17,720
Mr. Jin,

433
00:21:17,820 --> 00:21:18,340
please.

434
00:21:20,310 --> 00:21:20,970
Shangguan.

435
00:21:22,370 --> 00:21:24,680
Silly Liang is still in our hands.

436
00:21:27,030 --> 00:21:28,000
Just so you know.

437
00:21:30,200 --> 00:21:31,530
If you're that worried,

438
00:21:31,840 --> 00:21:32,990
let's go together.

439
00:21:41,720 --> 00:21:42,650
Later,

440
00:21:42,900 --> 00:21:43,730
play it by ear.

441
00:21:44,790 --> 00:21:46,000
If they try to stall,

442
00:21:46,550 --> 00:21:47,950
we'll fall out with them.

443
00:21:48,530 --> 00:21:51,180
Worst comes to worst,
we'll take Song out too.

444
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:52,840
Master, I think

445
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:55,720
we should let them finish the scam.

446
00:21:58,070 --> 00:21:59,920
Delays may lead to complications.

447
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:01,450
Why are you being so greedy?

448
00:22:01,480 --> 00:22:01,960
Master,

449
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:03,590
we've already got Shangguan Chengming

450
00:22:03,590 --> 00:22:05,050
firmly under our control.

451
00:22:05,170 --> 00:22:06,310
What is there to worry about?

452
00:22:06,310 --> 00:22:07,750
We have Silly Liang in our hands.

453
00:22:07,750 --> 00:22:08,790
And there's Fifth Batou.

454
00:22:08,790 --> 00:22:10,590
You and I can't lock her up,

455
00:22:10,680 --> 00:22:13,000
but the Sect Master is keeping an eye
on Zhang Dancheng.

456
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:15,350
In other words,
Fifth Batou is a hostage as well.

457
00:22:15,350 --> 00:22:17,270
We can't keep the Sect Master
waiting that long.

458
00:22:17,270 --> 00:22:17,830
One day.

459
00:22:18,550 --> 00:22:20,080
Let's just give him one day.

460
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:22,160
And think about it.

461
00:22:22,160 --> 00:22:23,440
If we really take

462
00:22:23,440 --> 00:22:25,510
Zhang Dancheng and Shangguan Chengming

463
00:22:25,510 --> 00:22:26,790
back now,

464
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:28,720
the Sect Master will kill Zhang Dancheng

465
00:22:28,720 --> 00:22:30,960
and officially acknowledge
Shangguan Chengming as his son.

466
00:22:30,960 --> 00:22:32,430
Will you still have a chance then?

467
00:22:32,430 --> 00:22:34,160
Why do you think the Sect Master

468
00:22:34,270 --> 00:22:36,800
likes that brat Shangguan Chengming
so much?

469
00:22:37,000 --> 00:22:39,400
Because he always manages to surprise him.

470
00:22:39,720 --> 00:22:41,320
Let's just keep an eye on him,

471
00:22:41,510 --> 00:22:42,680
let him finish the scam,

472
00:22:42,680 --> 00:22:44,440
then bring back both of them
and the money.

473
00:22:44,440 --> 00:22:46,960
Then we can also give the Sect Master
a surprise.

474
00:22:46,960 --> 00:22:47,640
What if

475
00:22:48,110 --> 00:22:50,770
we wait until Zhang Dancheng
finishes the scam,

476
00:22:51,240 --> 00:22:52,680
then kill them both?

477
00:22:59,440 --> 00:23:00,960
When we report back,

478
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:02,550
we'll say

479
00:23:03,830 --> 00:23:06,550
the two of them turned against each other

480
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:09,050
and killed one another.

481
00:23:14,830 --> 00:23:15,480
Mr. Jin,

482
00:23:15,680 --> 00:23:16,510
we're here.

483
00:23:17,270 --> 00:23:19,730
This is the auction house
where I bought the fake painting.

484
00:23:19,730 --> 00:23:20,550
You must find a way

485
00:23:20,010 --> 00:23:24,910
[Dongyu Chenggu Auction House]

486
00:23:20,550 --> 00:23:22,680
to get me the real one.

487
00:23:23,790 --> 00:23:25,070
Ladies and gentlemen,

488
00:23:25,270 --> 00:23:26,510
distinguished guests,

489
00:23:26,510 --> 00:23:29,000
welcome to this grand auction!

490
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:33,400
I'm your host today,

491
00:23:33,440 --> 00:23:35,880
and it's my great honor to bring you

492
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:37,880
this spectacular auction.

493
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:38,730
Alright,

494
00:23:39,030 --> 00:23:41,720
let's begin with our first lot.

495
00:23:41,920 --> 00:23:44,240
This is a Chenghui Hundred Flowers Vase

496
00:23:44,350 --> 00:23:45,720
from the Qianlong era.

497
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:46,860
The opening bid

498
00:23:47,550 --> 00:23:48,550
is 100 fabi.

499
00:23:49,200 --> 00:23:49,790
100 fabi!

500
00:23:49,790 --> 00:23:51,680
Okay, now it's 100 fabi.

501
00:23:51,790 --> 00:23:53,110
Any higher bid?

502
00:23:53,310 --> 00:23:53,960
200 fabi!

503
00:23:53,960 --> 00:23:54,960
Alright, 200.

504
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:57,070
Tell me,

505
00:23:57,070 --> 00:23:57,880
how does an auction house

506
00:23:57,880 --> 00:23:59,270
run scams on the rich?

507
00:24:01,030 --> 00:24:02,680
It's like a restaurant serving fish.

508
00:24:02,680 --> 00:24:04,350
When they show the fish to you,
it's alive.

509
00:24:04,350 --> 00:24:05,550
Once it goes into the kitchen,

510
00:24:05,550 --> 00:24:06,750
they swap it out for a dead one.

511
00:24:06,750 --> 00:24:08,070
You have to figure out

512
00:24:08,240 --> 00:24:10,700
how they switch out
the real pieces for fakes

513
00:24:10,750 --> 00:24:12,810
before you know how to make your move.

514
00:24:12,880 --> 00:24:14,240
Three hundred, going three times!

515
00:24:14,240 --> 00:24:15,500
Sold to the gentleman!

516
00:24:20,310 --> 00:24:21,390
Alright, everyone.

517
00:24:21,390 --> 00:24:23,100
They'll bring the real piece in

518
00:24:23,100 --> 00:24:24,500
through that door later.

519
00:24:24,880 --> 00:24:26,480
There's a hallway behind it.

520
00:24:26,790 --> 00:24:28,070
At the end of the hallway

521
00:24:28,070 --> 00:24:30,030
is a room called the Treasure Vault.

522
00:24:30,030 --> 00:24:30,830
Open the door.

523
00:24:31,390 --> 00:24:33,920
Only a special key
carried by one of the guards

524
00:24:33,960 --> 00:24:35,440
can open the door.

525
00:24:36,540 --> 00:24:38,400
Every item here has two versions:

526
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:39,480
one genuine

527
00:24:39,700 --> 00:24:40,540
and one fake.

528
00:24:41,400 --> 00:24:43,270
All the genuine pieces
that are sold at auction

529
00:24:43,270 --> 00:24:44,670
will be put into storage.

530
00:24:45,880 --> 00:24:47,070
But be careful.

531
00:24:47,810 --> 00:24:50,130
All the guards here are armed.

532
00:24:53,110 --> 00:24:54,110
Alright, everyone.

533
00:24:54,110 --> 00:24:56,750
Next up is a painting by Master Zheng.

534
00:24:56,750 --> 00:24:57,610
The opening bid

535
00:24:57,790 --> 00:24:58,750
is 200 francs.

536
00:24:59,240 --> 00:25:01,310
Anyone bid 200?

537
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:05,830
Will it go unsold if nobody bids?

538
00:25:06,480 --> 00:25:07,680
Wait a little longer.

539
00:25:11,550 --> 00:25:12,110
200!

540
00:25:12,110 --> 00:25:13,110
Alright, 200!

541
00:25:13,110 --> 00:25:14,110
We have 200.

542
00:25:14,110 --> 00:25:15,480
Anyone want to go higher?

543
00:25:15,480 --> 00:25:16,160
300!

544
00:25:16,160 --> 00:25:17,440
Alright, 300!

545
00:25:17,750 --> 00:25:20,030
The buyer is called Paozi.

546
00:25:20,030 --> 00:25:22,030
The moment Paozi bids,

547
00:25:22,440 --> 00:25:24,300
the shill will drive up the price.

548
00:25:25,160 --> 00:25:25,590
400!

549
00:25:25,590 --> 00:25:26,480
400!

550
00:25:26,480 --> 00:25:27,510
Now it's 400!

551
00:25:27,510 --> 00:25:28,480
500 fabi!

552
00:25:28,550 --> 00:25:29,440
500!

553
00:25:29,440 --> 00:25:30,400
Now it's 500!

554
00:25:30,400 --> 00:25:31,330
We're at 500 now.

555
00:25:31,480 --> 00:25:33,880
Aren't they afraid
no one will bid higher than them?

556
00:25:33,880 --> 00:25:36,030
It's the same with fortune-telling.

557
00:25:36,400 --> 00:25:38,030
Before every auction,
there would be someone

558
00:25:38,030 --> 00:25:41,640
approaching the Paozis
and striking up a conversation.

559
00:25:41,640 --> 00:25:43,590
They already know the highest price

560
00:25:43,590 --> 00:25:45,350
each Paozi is willing to pay.

561
00:25:45,550 --> 00:25:47,010
Five hundred, going once!

562
00:25:47,270 --> 00:25:48,750
Five hundred, going twice!

563
00:25:48,750 --> 00:25:49,030
Five hundred...

564
00:25:49,030 --> 00:25:49,590
Six hundred!

565
00:25:49,590 --> 00:25:50,440
Six hundred!

566
00:25:51,070 --> 00:25:52,350
We're at 600!

567
00:25:52,720 --> 00:25:54,270
Any higher bids?

568
00:25:55,350 --> 00:25:55,880
Alright.

569
00:25:56,160 --> 00:25:57,560
Six hundred, going once!

570
00:25:57,720 --> 00:25:59,160
Six hundred, going twice!

571
00:25:59,160 --> 00:26:00,640
Six hundred, going three times!

572
00:26:00,640 --> 00:26:01,270
Congratulations!

573
00:26:01,270 --> 00:26:02,640
Sold to the gentleman!

574
00:26:21,000 --> 00:26:21,920
What's wrong with you?

575
00:26:21,920 --> 00:26:23,030
Watch where you're going!

576
00:26:23,030 --> 00:26:25,350
Can you afford to pay for this
if you break it?

577
00:26:25,350 --> 00:26:25,960
Hurry up!

578
00:26:26,310 --> 00:26:26,790
I'm sorry.

579
00:26:26,790 --> 00:26:27,720
What happened?

580
00:26:28,830 --> 00:26:30,380
We just bumped into each other.

581
00:26:30,380 --> 00:26:31,290
Go ahead.

582
00:26:37,110 --> 00:26:38,640
I've never seen you before.

583
00:26:39,070 --> 00:26:39,750
New here?

584
00:26:44,070 --> 00:26:44,590
Stop!

585
00:26:48,110 --> 00:26:48,750
Sir,

586
00:26:49,110 --> 00:26:49,970
your painting.

587
00:26:53,310 --> 00:26:53,910
Thank you.

588
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:58,160
Congratulations, sir.

589
00:26:58,160 --> 00:26:58,720
Congratulations.

590
00:26:58,720 --> 00:26:59,350
What is it?

591
00:26:59,350 --> 00:27:00,160
Nothing.

592
00:27:00,160 --> 00:27:02,400
We're admirers of Master Zheng.

593
00:27:03,100 --> 00:27:05,790
Would you do us the honor
of letting us have a look?

594
00:27:05,790 --> 00:27:07,480
You were the ones bidding against me

595
00:27:07,480 --> 00:27:09,030
at the auction just now, weren't you?

596
00:27:09,030 --> 00:27:09,830
Impossible.

597
00:27:09,830 --> 00:27:10,640
Definitely not.

598
00:27:10,640 --> 00:27:12,830
We would never take something
someone else loves.

599
00:27:12,830 --> 00:27:13,440
Yes.

600
00:27:13,440 --> 00:27:15,350
We just want to have a look.

601
00:27:15,510 --> 00:27:15,970
Really?

602
00:27:16,200 --> 00:27:16,590
Yes.

603
00:27:16,590 --> 00:27:17,070
Really.

604
00:27:19,330 --> 00:27:19,960
Fine.

605
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:22,450
Let me show you!

606
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:24,070
Thank you.

607
00:27:24,510 --> 00:27:25,350
It's an honor.

608
00:27:30,880 --> 00:27:32,110
What a beautiful painting.

609
00:27:32,110 --> 00:27:33,270
And look at the calligraphy.

610
00:27:33,270 --> 00:27:35,240
What beautiful bamboo.

611
00:27:35,240 --> 00:27:35,960
Never seen anything like it, have you?

612
00:27:35,960 --> 00:27:36,590
No, no.

613
00:27:36,590 --> 00:27:37,200
Never.

614
00:27:37,200 --> 00:27:39,200
I saw it with my own eyes just now.

615
00:27:39,270 --> 00:27:41,640
This is definitely
an original by Zheng Banqiao.

616
00:27:41,640 --> 00:27:42,350
Yes.

617
00:27:42,400 --> 00:27:43,600
Guaranteed genuine!

618
00:27:43,790 --> 00:27:44,720
Yes, guaranteed genuine.

619
00:27:44,720 --> 00:27:45,880
So wonderful.

620
00:27:45,880 --> 00:27:46,750
Amazing.

621
00:27:46,750 --> 00:27:47,550
So beautiful.

622
00:27:50,640 --> 00:27:51,350
This is...

623
00:27:52,410 --> 00:27:53,890
Tianxiang?

624
00:27:54,820 --> 00:27:55,720
What does this mean?

625
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:56,350
Well...

626
00:27:57,270 --> 00:27:58,310
Tianxiang?

627
00:28:00,030 --> 00:28:01,070
What does Tianxiang mean?

628
00:28:01,070 --> 00:28:01,830
I don't know.

629
00:28:02,200 --> 00:28:02,830
I don't know.

630
00:28:02,830 --> 00:28:03,830
What does it mean?

631
00:28:07,400 --> 00:28:08,240
What's wrong with you?

632
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:09,590
Watch where you're going!

633
00:28:09,590 --> 00:28:10,830
Can you afford to pay for this
if you break it?

634
00:28:10,830 --> 00:28:11,880
I'm sorry.

635
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:13,080
It's fake!

636
00:28:13,510 --> 00:28:14,550
You liars!

637
00:28:14,550 --> 00:28:15,880
This is a fake painting!

638
00:28:16,020 --> 00:28:16,950
Look!

639
00:28:17,550 --> 00:28:19,480
You can tell it's a fake at a glance!

640
00:28:19,720 --> 00:28:21,110
I spent 600 fabi on it!

641
00:28:21,550 --> 00:28:23,070
Are you even human?

642
00:28:23,960 --> 00:28:24,750
Once it's sold, there's no backing out!

643
00:28:24,750 --> 00:28:25,350
What?

644
00:28:26,680 --> 00:28:27,920
Don't come over!

645
00:28:29,030 --> 00:28:29,750
Calm down!

646
00:28:29,920 --> 00:28:31,200
Calm down?

647
00:28:47,110 --> 00:28:47,920
Zhao!

648
00:28:48,160 --> 00:28:48,960
Zhao, bad news.

649
00:28:48,960 --> 00:28:49,790
Something happened at the auction.

650
00:28:49,790 --> 00:28:50,480
Something happened?

651
00:28:50,480 --> 00:28:50,880
Yes.

652
00:28:50,880 --> 00:28:51,960
Stay here.

653
00:28:51,960 --> 00:28:52,960
I'll come to you later!

654
00:28:52,960 --> 00:28:54,350
Keep an eye on him!

655
00:28:54,350 --> 00:28:56,010
The three of you, come with me!

656
00:29:26,560 --> 00:29:27,880
What do you mean by fake?

657
00:29:27,880 --> 00:29:29,550
We gave it to you,

658
00:29:30,160 --> 00:29:31,400
and you brought it back.

659
00:29:31,400 --> 00:29:32,800
We don't know if it's even

660
00:29:32,990 --> 00:29:33,850
the same thing.

661
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:35,400
Are you trying to fool me?

662
00:29:35,920 --> 00:29:36,310
Here.

663
00:29:36,790 --> 00:29:37,790
Look what this is.

664
00:29:37,940 --> 00:29:40,100
Now you're turning around

665
00:29:40,130 --> 00:29:41,560
and accusing me?

666
00:29:41,830 --> 00:29:43,830
You'd better solve this today,

667
00:29:43,920 --> 00:29:46,160
or you'll all be going to jail.

668
00:29:50,030 --> 00:29:50,880
What do we do?

669
00:29:51,660 --> 00:29:53,720
How about we give him the real one?

670
00:29:54,240 --> 00:29:55,110
Weren't the fakes

671
00:29:55,110 --> 00:29:56,520
we've made before pretty convincing?

672
00:29:56,520 --> 00:29:57,580
Who knew there'd be

673
00:29:57,600 --> 00:29:59,330
an extra seal on this painting?

674
00:30:00,770 --> 00:30:01,290
It's...

675
00:30:04,280 --> 00:30:05,680
The painting is gone!

676
00:30:06,810 --> 00:30:07,890
The new guy!

677
00:30:21,890 --> 00:30:24,680
Did you get a good look at who did it?

678
00:30:25,030 --> 00:30:26,030
Mr. Lu,

679
00:30:26,160 --> 00:30:26,680
I...

680
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:27,710
I...

681
00:30:33,720 --> 00:30:34,550
It's okay.

682
00:30:34,750 --> 00:30:36,400
Now that you've admitted your fault,

683
00:30:36,400 --> 00:30:38,200
do your job properly from now on.

684
00:30:38,310 --> 00:30:38,840
Thank...

685
00:30:38,960 --> 00:30:39,960
Thank you, Mr. Lu!

686
00:30:40,030 --> 00:30:41,070
Thank you, Mr. Lu!

687
00:30:43,400 --> 00:30:44,030
Open it.

688
00:30:44,050 --> 00:30:44,860
Excuse me.

689
00:30:46,260 --> 00:30:47,110
Are you done?

690
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:50,880
Excuse me, sir.

691
00:30:51,680 --> 00:30:52,200
Sir.

692
00:30:52,940 --> 00:30:54,370
The auction is not over yet.

693
00:30:54,370 --> 00:30:56,520
Please don't rush to leave.

694
00:30:57,110 --> 00:30:57,920
What do you mean?

695
00:30:57,920 --> 00:30:58,920
Mr. Lu said

696
00:30:59,200 --> 00:31:00,100
everyone here today

697
00:31:00,100 --> 00:31:01,110
is our distinguished guest.

698
00:31:01,110 --> 00:31:03,170
He told us to take good care of you all.

699
00:31:04,160 --> 00:31:05,960
They may not be able to get out for now.

700
00:31:05,960 --> 00:31:08,020
Let's go back to the apartment first.

701
00:31:22,830 --> 00:31:23,310
Mr. Lu.

702
00:31:23,830 --> 00:31:25,690
We found this in the back hallway.

703
00:31:25,750 --> 00:31:27,410
It should belong to the thief.

704
00:31:37,510 --> 00:31:38,510
Who are you?

705
00:31:39,240 --> 00:31:39,880
Where is the painting?

706
00:31:39,880 --> 00:31:41,680
What are you talking about?
We know nothing.

707
00:31:41,680 --> 00:31:42,140
Search!

708
00:31:42,440 --> 00:31:42,720
Yes!

709
00:31:42,830 --> 00:31:43,510
Yes!

710
00:31:46,680 --> 00:31:47,810
Behind the cabinet!

711
00:31:49,110 --> 00:31:50,370
Check under the chair!

712
00:31:52,480 --> 00:31:53,810
We found nothing, Boss!

713
00:31:54,030 --> 00:31:55,400
Nothing here either, Boss!

714
00:31:55,400 --> 00:31:56,260
Take them away!

715
00:31:57,200 --> 00:31:57,640
Move!

716
00:32:20,440 --> 00:32:21,240
That's right.

717
00:32:23,870 --> 00:32:26,130
We'll use this painting to trade for him.

718
00:32:26,590 --> 00:32:27,070
Who?

719
00:32:28,480 --> 00:32:29,740
Shangguan Chengming?

720
00:32:30,960 --> 00:32:32,750
You and the painting are both here, right?

721
00:32:32,750 --> 00:32:34,010
If Lu Qinhai kills him,

722
00:32:34,880 --> 00:32:37,680
wouldn't that be
killing two birds with one stone?

723
00:32:38,040 --> 00:32:39,200
Let's go, Master.

724
00:32:48,000 --> 00:32:48,680
What?

725
00:32:49,920 --> 00:32:53,350
If anything happens to Chengming,

726
00:32:54,160 --> 00:32:56,690
how are you going to answer
to the Sect Master?

727
00:33:04,030 --> 00:33:05,230
What are you doing?

728
00:33:06,790 --> 00:33:07,850
What are you doing?

729
00:33:08,960 --> 00:33:09,640
Help!

730
00:33:10,270 --> 00:33:11,510
Help!

731
00:33:12,590 --> 00:33:13,880
Let me go!

732
00:33:14,960 --> 00:33:16,070
Let me go!

733
00:33:16,660 --> 00:33:18,020
Let me go!

734
00:33:19,750 --> 00:33:21,160
Let me go!

735
00:33:23,680 --> 00:33:24,830
Everyone outside

736
00:33:25,000 --> 00:33:25,930
is talking about

737
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:27,310
a new culture

738
00:33:27,660 --> 00:33:28,790
and a new way of life,

739
00:33:29,520 --> 00:33:30,920
but I stick to the old ways

740
00:33:31,070 --> 00:33:32,430
and these old things.

741
00:33:33,070 --> 00:33:34,440
Confucius said,

742
00:33:34,550 --> 00:33:36,680
"Restrain yourself and return
to propriety. That is benevolence."

743
00:33:36,680 --> 00:33:38,130
You know what that means?

744
00:33:39,090 --> 00:33:41,290
Don't look at what you shouldn't.

745
00:33:42,270 --> 00:33:44,270
Don't listen to what you shouldn't.

746
00:33:44,590 --> 00:33:46,110
And don't take

747
00:33:46,880 --> 00:33:48,310
what isn't yours.

748
00:33:49,350 --> 00:33:50,640
Back then,

749
00:33:51,120 --> 00:33:53,050
because I didn't understand that,

750
00:33:53,180 --> 00:33:55,150
I took something I shouldn't have

751
00:33:56,530 --> 00:33:57,780
and lost a hand for it.

752
00:34:00,240 --> 00:34:01,610
I'll only ask you once.

753
00:34:03,880 --> 00:34:05,110
Where's the painting?

754
00:34:05,110 --> 00:34:06,200
I sold it a long time ago.

755
00:34:06,200 --> 00:34:07,400
Who did you sell it to?

756
00:34:07,400 --> 00:34:08,280
Mr. Song.

757
00:34:08,400 --> 00:34:09,960
He said you tricked him with a fake,

758
00:34:09,960 --> 00:34:11,030
so he hired us

759
00:34:11,480 --> 00:34:13,940
to steal an original
by Master Zheng for him.

760
00:34:15,000 --> 00:34:16,920
That bastard Song.

761
00:34:17,699 --> 00:34:19,030
He's quite the schemer.

762
00:34:24,750 --> 00:34:26,870
You stole the painting

763
00:34:27,440 --> 00:34:28,840
right under my nose.

764
00:34:29,670 --> 00:34:32,659
Even if I can let go of the painting,

765
00:34:35,550 --> 00:34:36,840
I still need...

766
00:34:37,969 --> 00:34:39,010
to save face.

767
00:34:41,000 --> 00:34:41,800
Mr. Lu!

768
00:34:46,870 --> 00:34:47,679
Bring him in.

769
00:34:47,710 --> 00:34:48,350
Yes.

770
00:35:10,000 --> 00:35:10,730
The painting

771
00:35:11,540 --> 00:35:12,310
is real.

772
00:35:12,670 --> 00:35:13,970
I've given you the painting.

773
00:35:13,970 --> 00:35:14,900
Let him go.

774
00:35:15,050 --> 00:35:16,650
Sixth Master, I'm here!

775
00:35:16,880 --> 00:35:17,800
Sixth Master!

776
00:35:18,710 --> 00:35:19,760
Sixth Master!

777
00:35:22,070 --> 00:35:23,530
It's only right for a thief

778
00:35:23,680 --> 00:35:25,070
to return stolen goods.

779
00:35:25,320 --> 00:35:26,480
Keeping him here

780
00:35:27,550 --> 00:35:28,360
is even more

781
00:35:28,390 --> 00:35:31,470
justified.

782
00:35:32,070 --> 00:35:33,600
For such a big auction house

783
00:35:34,230 --> 00:35:35,980
to resort to such dirty tricks—

784
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:37,260
is that only right too?

785
00:35:37,320 --> 00:35:38,850
What are you talking about?

786
00:35:38,850 --> 00:35:40,650
You run auctions on the surface,

787
00:35:40,880 --> 00:35:42,000
but behind the scenes,

788
00:35:42,000 --> 00:35:43,760
you swap genuine pieces for fakes.

789
00:35:43,760 --> 00:35:44,920
Your treasures

790
00:35:44,940 --> 00:35:47,190
never make it into the hands
of ordinary people.

791
00:35:47,190 --> 00:35:48,000
Tell me,

792
00:35:49,550 --> 00:35:51,150
if some government official

793
00:35:51,840 --> 00:35:54,700
finds out you've been
pulling these tricks on them,

794
00:35:57,070 --> 00:35:58,730
do you think you can handle it?

795
00:36:06,960 --> 00:36:08,850
You don't

796
00:36:08,960 --> 00:36:11,440
look much like a thief.

797
00:36:11,630 --> 00:36:14,230
You don't look much like a businessman
either.

798
00:36:23,070 --> 00:36:23,730
Detective,

799
00:36:24,030 --> 00:36:24,690
that's him.

800
00:36:24,820 --> 00:36:25,820
He sold me a fake.

801
00:36:25,880 --> 00:36:27,150
I have the evidence right here!

802
00:36:27,150 --> 00:36:27,880
Nonsense!

803
00:36:28,070 --> 00:36:29,710
You sent people here to steal from me.

804
00:36:29,710 --> 00:36:31,280
We have both witnesses and evidence
right here!

805
00:36:31,280 --> 00:36:31,770
Detective,

806
00:36:31,770 --> 00:36:32,830
don't believe him.

807
00:36:33,030 --> 00:36:34,110
Look at my face.

808
00:36:34,210 --> 00:36:35,330
They did this to me.

809
00:36:36,380 --> 00:36:36,970
Look!

810
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:38,840
They're even using torture on him!

811
00:36:38,840 --> 00:36:39,550
Detective,

812
00:36:39,760 --> 00:36:41,320
he's just making false accusations
against me!

813
00:36:41,320 --> 00:36:41,980
Detective.

814
00:36:42,230 --> 00:36:43,290
Alright, alright.

815
00:36:43,610 --> 00:36:44,850
I'll take both the witnesses

816
00:36:44,850 --> 00:36:47,510
and the items back
and investigate thoroughly.

817
00:36:48,670 --> 00:36:49,330
Detective,

818
00:36:49,880 --> 00:36:52,320
Director Wang's stuff is also here.

819
00:36:52,840 --> 00:36:54,500
You can leave my things alone,

820
00:36:54,630 --> 00:36:55,800
can't you?

821
00:36:55,970 --> 00:36:56,900
Cut the crap.

822
00:36:58,240 --> 00:37:00,070
They're all evidence.

823
00:37:01,590 --> 00:37:02,590
Take them away!

824
00:37:03,630 --> 00:37:04,800
Let me go!

825
00:37:05,960 --> 00:37:07,670
Sixth Master, I'm here!

826
00:37:07,700 --> 00:37:08,660
Sixth Master!

827
00:37:19,050 --> 00:37:20,400
Thank Detective Guo for me.

828
00:37:20,400 --> 00:37:21,240
See you.

829
00:37:35,630 --> 00:37:36,360
Detective,

830
00:37:36,920 --> 00:37:39,000
Lu Qinhai's men have confessed.

831
00:37:39,070 --> 00:37:39,960
Well?

832
00:37:40,190 --> 00:37:40,920
This Lu guy

833
00:37:40,920 --> 00:37:42,800
used to specialize
in arranging contract killings.

834
00:37:42,800 --> 00:37:44,320
He built his business
on more than a dozen lives.

835
00:37:44,320 --> 00:37:45,230
As long as he was paid,

836
00:37:45,230 --> 00:37:46,670
he would kill anyone.
Including a woman in her 60s.

837
00:37:46,670 --> 00:37:47,630
Bastard.

838
00:37:47,800 --> 00:37:49,260
He's worse than an animal!

839
00:37:50,030 --> 00:37:50,920
Don't be angry.

840
00:37:51,320 --> 00:37:53,980
Detective Guo,
you made another contribution.

841
00:37:54,960 --> 00:37:56,510
Sixth Master, please wait for a minute.

842
00:37:56,510 --> 00:37:58,440
I'll bring your man to you shortly.

843
00:37:58,920 --> 00:37:59,520
Thank you.

844
00:38:19,840 --> 00:38:21,230
The woman in her 60s
from the fishing village

845
00:38:21,230 --> 00:38:22,830
was also killed by Lu Qinhai?

846
00:38:23,150 --> 00:38:23,550
Yes.

847
00:38:24,150 --> 00:38:25,150
What was her name?

848
00:38:26,480 --> 00:38:27,410
I think it was...

849
00:38:28,960 --> 00:38:29,840
Wang Guifen.

850
00:38:30,360 --> 00:38:31,420
Why did he kill her?

851
00:38:32,420 --> 00:38:34,460
Someone paid him to kill her.

852
00:38:34,920 --> 00:38:35,980
How did he kill her?

853
00:38:36,590 --> 00:38:39,790
The person who paid him
said there couldn't be any wounds.

854
00:38:39,880 --> 00:38:42,340
So he suffocated the old woman
with a pillow.

855
00:39:06,270 --> 00:39:07,780
[Interrogation Room]

856
00:39:13,560 --> 00:39:15,080
Someone bailed you out.

857
00:39:15,250 --> 00:39:16,370
You can go now.

858
00:39:23,190 --> 00:39:24,070
Detective,

859
00:39:25,110 --> 00:39:26,880
about my evidence...

860
00:39:27,070 --> 00:39:28,190
What evidence?

861
00:39:28,360 --> 00:39:29,690
Those are stolen goods!

862
00:39:30,920 --> 00:39:32,380
Do you want to leave or not?

863
00:39:34,070 --> 00:39:34,550
Yes.

864
00:39:34,960 --> 00:39:35,510
Yes.

865
00:39:58,950 --> 00:40:00,680
Master Swindler took the bait.

866
00:40:01,360 --> 00:40:02,710
I saw him

867
00:40:02,730 --> 00:40:04,770
take Fan Yifei and Lu Qinhai away.

868
00:40:05,400 --> 00:40:07,590
Lu Qinhai has some powerful connections.

869
00:40:07,590 --> 00:40:09,790
Most people wouldn't dare go after him.

870
00:40:09,880 --> 00:40:10,670
Luckily,

871
00:40:10,920 --> 00:40:12,300
Detective Guo cooperated.

872
00:40:12,300 --> 00:40:14,100
You can fool people, but not Heaven.

873
00:40:14,100 --> 00:40:15,760
Good and evil
will always have their consequences.

874
00:40:15,760 --> 00:40:17,390
The scam we set up for Master Swindler

875
00:40:17,390 --> 00:40:19,430
has finally come full circle.

876
00:40:19,450 --> 00:40:21,150
Now that we've helped Master Swindler

877
00:40:21,150 --> 00:40:22,670
find his real enemy,

878
00:40:22,920 --> 00:40:23,650
it's time...

879
00:40:25,340 --> 00:40:27,010
for him to help me.

880
00:40:30,480 --> 00:40:31,360
Good wine!

881
00:40:31,950 --> 00:40:32,950
Good wine!

882
00:40:40,880 --> 00:40:41,710
Good wine!

883
00:40:43,960 --> 00:40:44,590
Brother,

884
00:40:45,060 --> 00:40:46,390
didn't we

885
00:40:46,780 --> 00:40:48,130
already have a deal?

886
00:40:48,880 --> 00:40:50,880
Why did you bring me here for a drink?

887
00:40:51,510 --> 00:40:52,770
Remember Wang Guifen?

888
00:40:54,760 --> 00:40:55,690
I don't know her.

889
00:40:56,920 --> 00:40:58,050
Eighteen years ago.

890
00:40:59,030 --> 00:41:00,160
Li Fishing Village.

891
00:41:02,150 --> 00:41:03,010
I remember her.

892
00:41:03,190 --> 00:41:04,190
Did you kill her?

893
00:41:04,440 --> 00:41:05,230
I did.

894
00:41:09,630 --> 00:41:10,690
That was my mother.

895
00:41:16,600 --> 00:41:17,510
Who hired you?

896
00:41:20,230 --> 00:41:21,160
The Sect Master.

897
00:41:23,510 --> 00:41:24,760
Tell me the truth!

898
00:41:25,660 --> 00:41:27,590
The Sect Master of the Tianxiang Sect!

899
00:41:27,590 --> 00:41:28,870
He paid me!

900
00:42:05,720 --> 00:42:07,390
Whoever paid me,

901
00:42:08,370 --> 00:42:10,370
I did the job for them!

902
00:42:47,520 --> 00:42:49,790
[In the next episode]

903
00:42:50,630 --> 00:42:51,000
Master!

904
00:42:51,000 --> 00:42:51,480
Senior?

905
00:42:51,480 --> 00:42:51,880
Master!

906
00:42:51,880 --> 00:42:52,400
What's wrong?

907
00:42:52,400 --> 00:42:53,320
Master, what's wrong?

908
00:42:53,320 --> 00:42:54,450
The tea is poisoned.

909
00:42:54,630 --> 00:42:57,000
Take Shangguan Chengming away!

910
00:42:57,230 --> 00:42:58,000
Yes!

911
00:42:58,960 --> 00:42:59,710
Senior.

912
00:43:00,130 --> 00:43:01,790
The medicine is here, Senior.

913
00:43:02,150 --> 00:43:03,070
Senior?

914
00:43:03,510 --> 00:43:04,230
Senior!

915
00:43:07,430 --> 00:43:08,460
Senior,

916
00:43:08,830 --> 00:43:10,660
I will avenge you.

917
00:43:12,090 --> 00:43:13,430
I promise.
